  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic data and controlled providers; no real research quality acceptance.",
    "Record checks cover identity, size and present array containers; not all nested business fields or cross-record references.",
    "Recovery handles damaged existing records, recognized interrupted JSON writes and mismatched/missing originals; it does not infer all completely missing records.",
    "Database-page corruption stops business writes. Raw preservation does not claim database repair; whole-library recovery from an unusable source remains an offline workflow.",
    "No complete resource remeasurement, hardware power loss, physical disk exhaustion, minimum configuration, clean machine, Windows or arm64 acceptance.",
    "D1 remains in progress: compatibility recovery, migration preparation failures and cross-record transaction coordination."
  ]
}
